 "text": "Hi! How's life treating you? Some do, especially busy ones near rush hour. Others get reservations and don't mind wait. That works too, especially for places that don't keep a table. Just call a little before you set off and they' usually hold seat for you. Some places charge a cancellation fee, some don't. Check their terms when you book, and always call rather than cancel through the website. It' easy to skip. Just look at the fine print next time you book.",
